Subject: [PATCH] windows.devices.enumeration: Remove stray '5' from the list
 of legal special characters.

Wine-Bug: https://bugs.winehq.org/show_bug.cgi?id=60241

Signed-off-by: Vibhav Pant <vpant@codeweavers.com>
---
 dlls/windows.devices.enumeration/aqs.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

